      "value": "@{6a8a8f80523ad16133a03af5|full_name} Can you provide an affected video URL and a description of the issue?\n\nWithout steps to reproduce (including an URL), some commentary will be provided.\n\nSome YouTube URLs such as DRM-protected movies on YouTube is not and has never been supported by yt-dlp. Age-restricted videos also cannot be played without login. \"Sign-in to confirm you're not a bot\" is not resolvable. These scenarios are not necessarily bugs.\n\nThe most common issue is https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/issues/17456, described in https://ask.vrchat.com/t/video-players-completely-broken/48829/2.\n\nResolvable by: [Update to yt-dlp 2026.08.19](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/update-to-yt-dlp-20260819) (feature request)\n\nDuplicate bug report of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/video-bug",
